    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91564" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῠρᾰλίς</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῠραλλίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, an unknown <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bird</i>, perh. a kind of <i>pigeon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				609a18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				100c4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				4.5
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρραλίς</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> an <i>insect</i> said to
			live in fire, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				11.119
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαῖαι πυραλλίδες</span>, a <i>red</i>
			kind of olive, <i><span class="en">
				Phylotim.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				2.69.9
			</span></i>.</div>
